 result←object New arg;parent;name;actions;∆style;props;newobj;∆border
⍝ Create a new RichEdit object

⍝ Style bits (missing bits only used for Edit, otherwise shared codes):
⍝ 0 = One line
⍝ 4 = Multiline                                                                 ⍝? Dyalog does not provide single-line - simulate?
⍝ 8 = Inhibit automatic vertical scrolling (4∊)                                 ⍝? Create-only
⍝ 16 = Vertical scroll bar (4∊)                                                 ⍝? Create-only
⍝ 32 = Inhibit automatic horizontal scrolling (causes word-wrapping if 4∊)
⍝ 64 = Horizontal scroll bar                                                    ⍝? Create-only
⍝ 1024 = Do not hide selection when tabbing out of field
⍝ 2048 = APL entry field
⍝ 4096 = Read only                                                              ⍝? Simulate with CharFormat[1]←'Protected' ?? (What about when appending?)
⍝ 8192 = Allow Enter character as part of text (4∊)                             ⍝? Create-only
⍝ 16384 = Do not select text when tabbing back to control
⍝   Additional bits not used for Edit controls:
⍝ 32768 = Disable automatic word selection when highlighting with mouse
⍝ 65536 = Disable, rather than remove, unneeded scroll bars (∨/16 64∊)          ⍝? Unavailable in Dyalog
⍝ 131072 = Allow Tab character in text
⍝ 262144 = Advanced typography ⍝? (What is this?)
⍝? bits≥32768 not yet implemented

 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument
 actions←⊃¨⊆¨arg ⍝ The names of the actions that they've asked to create this object with

 (∆style ∆border)←((1↓¨arg),⊂⍬)[actions⍳'style' 'border']
 ∆border←0⌈×+/∊∆border ⋄ ∆style←##._supp.SetBitVals ∆style
 arg←(parent:parent ⋄ border:∆border)##.##.New.Center arg
 arg,←(~'edge'⊂⍛∊actions)/⊂'edge' 1 ⍝ RichEdit boxes have a default 'edge'

 props←'RichEdit'('Visible' 0) ⍝ Define properties that must be used during creation
 props,←⊂'VScroll'((~8∊∆style)×¯2+16∊∆style) ⍝ Can't support 8∧16 ⍝? Can only be set during creation
 props,←⊂'HScroll'((~32∊∆style)×¯2+64∊∆style) ⍝ Can't support 32∧64 ⍝? Can only be set during creation
 props,←⊂'PageWidth'((~32∊∆style)×99999) ⍝? Can only be set during creation
 props,←⊂'Border'∆border ⍝ Set border upon creation ⍝? Create-only
 props,←⊂'WantsReturn'(8192∊∆style) ⍝ Override default (1) if 8192 not specified ⍝? (Dyalog always allows Ctrl-Enter anyway unless we suppress it?) ⍝? Create-only style

 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object with required parameters
 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
